  "revision": 1,
  "title": "Z-Image Turbo: union ControlNet from a reference image's edges",
  "description": "Text to image with Z-Image Turbo whose composition follows a reference image: Canny edges of the reference drive the Z-Image Turbo Fun ControlNet Union model patch (ModelPatchLoader, QwenImageDiffsynthControlnet at strength 1), and the prompt decides content and style. The latent has the edge map's size, so the output has the reference image's size, rounded down to a multiple of 8 by the latent; the contract check refuses a reference whose sides aren't multiples of 8. 8 steps of res_multistep at CFG 1.0 with ModelSamplingAuraFlow shift 3, as ComfyUI's template samples. The patch file goes into model_patches/.",
